# GitHub Pages hosting (spdc.church)

This repository hosts **https://spdc.church** on **GitHub Pages**.

## Hard rules
- **Never** change repository visibility to Private / Internal.
- Free GitHub Pages does **not** work on private repos and shows: "There isn't a GitHub Pages site here."
- Keep `CNAME` as `spdc.church`.
- Keep Pages source: branch `main`, folder `/` (root), HTTPS enforced.

## If the site 404s
1. Confirm visibility is **Public** (`gh repo view --json visibility`)
2. Re-enable Pages on `main` /
3. Confirm custom domain `spdc.church` + HTTPS

A scheduled workflow `.github/workflows/pages-keepalive.yml` monitors this and tries to auto-repair.
